		(property "Description" "10k PA15 pull-up; MCU leakage drop ~2.5mV at 250nA. The ROM bootloader's SPI3 slave uses PA15 as NSS with no pull (AN2606 Rev 62 Table 114); holding it high keeps SPI3 (PC10-PC12, the front motor bus) from being selected instead of USB DFU."
